# No browser-side keys are needed. Everything secret lives in Vercel → Project → Settings → Environment Variables:
# RESEND_API_KEY, LEADS_FROM_EMAIL, LEADS_NOTIFY_EMAIL, GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID, GOOGLE_CLIENT_SECRET, GOOGLE_REFRESH_TOKEN, GOOGLE_SHEET_ID
# Never put a secret in a VITE_ variable: anything starting with VITE_ is copied into the public website code.
